`n` (from the Schwartz decay of `𝓕⁻ χ` of order `n + 2` and scaling). -/
lemma norm_mul_norm_liftPhi_le (n : ℕ) :
    ∃ K : ℝ, 0 ≤ K ∧ ∀ (d : ℕ) (Ω : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ) (p : ℝ) (s : ℕ)
